{"speciesId":229,"names":{"fr":"Démolosse","es":"Houndoom","en":"Houndoom","ja":"ヘルガー"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"gold","text":"If you are burned by the flames it shoots from its mouth, the pain will never go away."},{"language":"en","version":"silver","text":"Upon hearing its eerie howls, other POKéMON get the shivers and head straight back to their nests."},{"language":"en","version":"crystal","text":"The pungent- smelling flame that shoots from its mouth results from toxins burn­ ing in its body."},{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"In a HOUNDOOM pack, the one with its horns raked sharply towards the back serves a leadership role. These POKéMON choose their leader by fighting amongst themselves."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"In a HOUNDOOM pack, the one with its horns raked sharply towards the back serves a leadership role. These POKéMON choose their leader by fighting amongst themselves."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"In a HOUNDOOM pack, the one with its horns raked sharply back serves a leadership role. They choose their leader by fighting among themselves."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"Upon hearing its eerie howls, other POKéMON get the shivers and head straight back to their nests."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"If you are burned by the flames it shoots from its mouth, the pain will never go away."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"Long ago, people imagined its eerie howls to be the call of the grim reaper."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"Long ago, people imagined its eerie howls to be the call of the grim reaper."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"The flames it breathes when angry contain toxins. If they cause a burn, it will hurt forever."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"If you are burned by the flames it shoots from its mouth, the pain will never go away."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"Upon hearing its eerie howls, other Pokémon get the shivers and head straight back to their nests."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"En colère, il crache des flammes contenant une toxine qui peut causer des dégâts irréversibles."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"The flames it breathes when angry contain toxins. If they cause a burn, it will hurt forever."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"En colère, il crache des flammes contenant une toxine qui peut causer des dégâts irréversibles."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"The flames it breathes when angry contain toxins. If they cause a burn, it will hurt forever."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"The flames it breathes when angry contain toxins. If they cause a burn, it will hurt forever."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"The flames it breathes when angry contain toxins. If they cause a burn, it will hurt forever."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Jadis, les gens prenaient son étrange hurlement pour l’appel de la Faucheuse."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Hace mucho, la gente creía que sus horripilantes aullidos eran de la muerte personificada."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"Long ago, people imagined its eerie howls to be the call of the grim reaper."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"ヘルガーの 不気味な 遠ぼえは 地獄から 死神が 呼ぶ 声と 昔の 人は 想像していた。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"En colère, il crache des flammes contenant une toxine qui peut causer des dégâts irréversibles."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Las llamas que respira cuando se enfada contienen toxinas. Si causan una quemadura, dolerá toda la vida."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"The flames it breathes when angry contain toxins. If they cause a burn, it will hurt forever."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"怒ったときに 口から 噴き出す 炎には 毒素も 混じっていて やけどになると いつまでも うずく。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Dans une meute de Démolosse, le leader est doté de cornes inclinées vers l’arrière. Ces Pokémon choisissent leur chef en organisant des combats entre eux."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"En la manada de Houndoom, el que tiene los cuernos más arqueados hacia atrás tiene un mayor papel de liderazgo. Estos Pokémon suelen elegir al jefe en duelo."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"In a Houndoom pack, the one with its horns raked sharply toward the back serves a leadership role. These Pokémon choose their leader by fighting among themselves."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"頭の ツノが 大きく 反り返って いる ヘルガーが グループの リーダー的 存在。 仲間 同士で 争い リーダーが 決まる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Dans une meute de Démolosse, le leader est doté de cornes inclinées vers l’arrière. Ces Pokémon choisissent leur chef en organisant des combats entre eux."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"En la manada de Houndoom, el que tiene los cuernos más arqueados hacia atrás tiene un mayor papel de liderazgo. Estos Pokémon suelen elegir al jefe en duelo."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"In a Houndoom pack, the one with its horns raked sharply toward the back serves a leadership role. These Pokémon choose their leader by fighting among themselves."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"頭の ツノが 大きく 反り返って いる ヘルガーが グループの リーダー的 存在。 仲間 同士で 争い リーダーが 決まる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Il crache des flammes empoisonnées pour achever ses proies, qu’il partage avec les autres membres de sa meute."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Remata a sus rivales exhalando llamas tóxicas. Si abate una presa, la compartirá a partes iguales con el resto de la manada."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"They spew flames mixed with poison to finish off their opponents. They divvy up their prey evenly among the members of their pack."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"毒素の 混じった 炎を 吹いて 相手に 止めを 刺す。 獲物は 群れで 平等に 分け合うぞ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Ceux qui le craignaient jadis lui ont donné le surnom de « messager de la Faucheuse » à cause de son hurlement sinistre si particulier."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Su rasgo distintivo son los escalofriantes aullidos que profiere. Antiguamente, era temido y considerado un emisario del inframundo."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Identifiable by its eerie howls, people a long time ago thought it was the grim reaper and feared it."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"不気味な 遠吠えが 特徴。 昔の 人は 地獄 からの 使いと 考え 恐れていた。"}],"varieties":[{"id":229,"moves":[{"name":"headbutt","learns":[[3,"machine",0],[4,"machine",0],[10,"tutor",0]]},{"name":"body-slam","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0],[13,"tutor",0],[25,"machine",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"take-down","learns":[[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"double-edge","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0],[13,"tutor",0],[25,"machine",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"leer","learns":[[3,"level-up",1],[4,"level-up",1],[5,"level-up",1],[6,"level-up",1],[7,"level-up",1],[8,"level-up",1],[9,"level-up",1],[10,"level-up",1],[11,"level-up",1],[12,"level-up",1],[13,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[23,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"bite","learns":[[3,"level-up",20],[4,"level-up",20],[5,"level-up",27],[6,"level-up",27],[7,"level-up",27],[8,"level-up",17],[9,"level-up",17],[10,"level-up",17],[11,"level-up",16],[12,"level-up",27],[13,"level-up",27],[14,"level-up",16],[15,"level-up",16],[16,"level-up",16],[17,"level-up",16],[18,"level-up",16],[23,"level-up",16],[25,"level-up",16],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"roar","learns":[[3,"level-up",7],[3,"machine",0],[4,"level-up",7],[4,"machine",0],[5,"level-up",19],[5,"machine",0],[6,"level-up",19],[6,"machine",0],[7,"level-up",19],[7,"machine",0],[8,"level-up",14],[8,"machine",0],[9,"level-up",14],[9,"machine",0],[10,"level-up",14],[10,"ma